./scripts/devstack.zsh start
./scripts/devstack.zsh status
./scripts/devstack.zsh restart
./scripts/devstack.zsh stop


Notes
Redis startup is auto-handled with fallback logic:
tries brew services start redis
then brew services start redis@7
then redis-server
Django/Celery/Vite run in background with logs under logs/dev/:
logs/dev/django.log
logs/dev/celery.log
logs/dev/vite.log
logs/dev/redis.log (if local redis-server path is used)
